00:24:02.090 --> 00:24:04.710
It's just, it's not the system itself.

00:24:04.710 --> 00:24:06.450
It's what they did with the system.

00:24:06.990 --> 00:24:08.290
Okay. I agree with that.

00:24:08.470 --> 00:24:15.510
