Yeah. It's like a woods or, yeah.

00:27:18.630 --> 00:27:19.450
There's like cabins.

00:27:20.170 --> 00:27:21.530
Yeah. So I'm in like that part.

00:27:21.590 --> 00:27:28.170
I was able to tell that, but it wasn't helpful enough in terms of like, I'm constantly referring back to the map and trying to figure out like, okay, I'm here.

