And now, you know, if you were lucky enough to get one of those locators, it would blink like where somebody was.

00:27:34.710 --> 00:27:38.890
And even that didn't make it like so easy, you know, like you would be like, okay, cool.

00:27:38.990 --> 00:27:40.070
They're up in the top left.

00:27:40.270 --> 00:27:41.130
I'm in the bottom left.

00:27:41.210 --> 00:27:42.790
So I just kind of had to figure out a way to get up.

