00:30:07.310 --> 00:30:19.310
I guess the weirdest thing for me about this game is that it takes the movie, which is all about, you know, friendship and teamwork and getting along as a group.

00:30:19.310 --> 00:30:25.590
And it just takes one of you and does this whole, uh, go save everyone, but they're not going to come with you.

00:30:25.970 --> 00:30:27.050
They're just going to run away.

00:30:27.070 --> 00:30:27.990
I love that point.

00:30:28.130 --> 00:30:34.230
That's such a good point. Why, why didn't you, after like saving one of them, have the option to like acquire his ability to use him?

00:30:34.370 --> 00:30:42.150
Yeah. Like, you know, if, if we're going to just jump ahead to a second to Super Mario Brothers 2, you can tackle each of those levels as Mario, Luigi, Toad, or Peach.

00:30:42.230 --> 00:30:43.690
