00:30:43.830 --> 00:30:50.910
Exactly. It would be cool if you started off with like the Mario character, Mikey, and then like as you went through, it's like this one jumps a little higher.

00:30:51.230 --> 00:30:52.830
And this one is a little faster.

00:30:52.850 --> 00:30:54.630
