00:31:11.910 --> 00:31:13.530
You can just have that be another window.

00:31:13.770 --> 00:31:19.550
That's true. Yeah. So I think that's a missed opportunity and I don't know why they went with that choice, but.

00:31:19.690 --> 00:31:32.310
