00:31:42.390 --> 00:31:45.390
Right. Yeah. I mean, and it feels a lot like Zelda.

00:31:45.610 --> 00:31:52.690
It's riding on that Zelda success for sure of just, you know, another, you know, just looking at like even the way that they designed the manual.

00:31:52.990 --> 00:31:59.630
